    story: Rafael Sunmonger was born in a salt flat camp, where water, shade, and distance shaped every decision. As a child, Rafael Sunmonger lived through a butcher block, learning anatomy, steady hands, and why blood should not freeze the mind. As a young adult, Rafael Sunmonger worked through a mat sweeper job, sweeping floors, correcting stances, and stealing lessons from the edge of the mat. They enter the dojo to stand on the mat as a fighter.
